---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/lab-hud.css';
---

<ToolLayout
  title="ISS 卫星过顶 · 几点抬头看"
  description="根据你的位置，算出国际空间站未来 48 小时何时从天上飞过、有多接近头顶。"
  currentSlug="sat-pass"
>
  <h1 slot="header">卫星过顶</h1>
  <p class="intro">
    国际空间站（ISS）从你家天上飞过时，往往是肉眼可见的亮点。本页告诉你<strong>下次该几点抬头</strong>，以及飞得多正头顶。
  </p>

  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Oxanium:wght@500;700&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  />

  <div class="lab-hud lab-hero">
    <p class="lab-story">
      <strong>这页干嘛：</strong>查<strong>ISS 过顶时刻</strong>。仰角越高越接近「正头顶」，越好找。轨道快照由站点定期更新；超过 7 天立即停算。几何过境不保证肉眼可见。
    </p>

    <p class="sat-freshness" id="sat-freshness" role="status">正在校验轨道数据</p>
    <canvas id="sat-canvas" class="lab-hero-canvas" aria-label="ISS 过顶天穹预测"></canvas>

    <div class="sat-viz-controls"><p class="lab-note">青线 = 可能可见；灰线 = 其余几何轨迹 · 北上、东右、中心天顶</p><button type="button" class="lab-btn secondary" id="sat-pause" aria-pressed="false">暂停示意动画</button></div>
    <div class="lab-cards" aria-label="下次过顶">
      <div class="lab-card">
        <span class="lab-card-k">下次过顶</span>
        <span class="lab-card-v amber" id="sat-card-when">计算中…</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-card">
        <span class="lab-card-k">最高有多正头顶</span>
        <span class="lab-card-v" id="sat-card-el">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-card">
        <span class="lab-card-k">开始时朝哪看</span>
        <span class="lab-card-v" id="sat-card-az">—</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="sat-countdown" id="sat-countdown" aria-label="距下次开始的倒计时">—</p>
    <p class="lab-hero-caption lab-amber" id="sat-next">计算中…</p>

    <p class="lab-note">预测范围 <span id="sat-range">—</span></p>
    <p class="lab-note" role="status" id="sat-fetch-status">使用已校验的内置快照</p>
    <div class="lab-controls"><label>显示 <select id="sat-filter"><option value="visible">可能肉眼可见</option><option value="geometric">所有几何过境</option></select></label><button type="button" class="lab-btn secondary" id="sat-refresh">刷新轨道数据</button></div>
    <div class="sat-pass-cards" id="sat-pass-cards" aria-label="过境观测建议"></div>
    <details class="lab-details" open>
      <summary>观测点与几何过境明细</summary>
      <p class="lab-note">真实 TLE 历元 <span class="lab-amber" id="sat-updated">—</span> · <span id="sat-geo-note">—</span></p>
      <p class="lab-note">抓取时间 <span id="sat-fetched">—</span> · 抓取时间不等于轨道历元</p>
      <div class="lab-controls">
        <label>纬度 <input type="number" id="sat-lat" step="0.0001" /></label>
        <label>经度 <input type="number" id="sat-lon" step="0.0001" /></label>
        <label>观测时区 <input type="text" id="sat-zone" aria-label="观测点 IANA 时区" /></label>
        <button type="button" class="lab-btn" id="sat-apply">重算</button>
        <button type="button" class="lab-btn secondary" id="sat-gps">定位</button>
      </div>
      <p class="lab-meta" id="sat-status">—</p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>越过地平线</th><th>飞到最高</th><th>落下地平线</th><th>最高高度/方位</th><th>可能可见窗口</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="sat-rows"></tbody>
      </table>
    </details>
  </div>

  <p class="intro">例如：北京用 Asia/Shanghai，纽约用 America/New_York。轨迹是整次几何过境的加速示意，中心是天顶。筛选条件为 ISS 仰角 ≥10°、太阳高度 ≤−6°、空间站完全受日照；地影采用近似球形地球模型，不计云、地形、光污染和空间站姿态，不能保证看见。</p>
  <p class="intro">数据：<a href="https://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?CATNR=25544&amp;FORMAT=TLE">CelesTrak ISS TLE</a>；传播：SGP4 / satellite.js；观测条件参考 <a href="https://www.nasa.gov/missions/station/spot-the-station-frequently-asked-questions/">NASA Spot the Station</a>。刷新只向本站请求公开轨道快照，不上传坐标。</p>
  <div class="lab-related">
    <h2>相关</h2>
    <a href="/tools/astro-today/">今日星空</a>
    <a href="/space/">轻星图</a>
    <a href="/tools/orbit-lab/">轨道实验</a>
  </div>
</ToolLayout>

<script>
  import { bootSatPass } from '../../scripts/sat-pass/main';
  bootSatPass();
</script>

<style>
  .sat-freshness { margin: .8rem 0; color: #94edcd; border: 1px solid #284d4c; padding: .7rem; border-radius: 8px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .sat-freshness.sat-warning { color: #ffc857; border-color: #87652b; }
  .sat-countdown { color: #ffc857; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 4vw, 1.5rem); font-weight: 600; margin: 1rem 0 .3rem; }
  .sat-viz-controls { display: flex; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .sat-pass-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 270px), 1fr)); gap: .75rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .sat-pass-cards :global(.sat-pass-card) { padding: 1rem; background: #081727; border: 1px solid #28485d; border-radius: 10px; min-width: 0; }
  .sat-pass-cards :global(h3) { color: #ecf4ff; margin: .4rem 0; font-size: 1rem; }
  .sat-pass-cards :global(p) { font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .sat-pass-cards :global(.sat-pass-kind) { color: #ffc857; font-size: .8rem; margin: 0; }
  .sat-pass-cards :global(button[aria-pressed="true"]) { border-color: #00e8ff; color: #00e8ff; }
  .lab-note { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .lab-controls input, .lab-controls select { min-height: 42px; max-width: 100%; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .lab-details { overflow-x: auto; } .sat-pass-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
